'''Purrloin''' (Japanese: '''チョロネコ''' ''Choroneko'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

